From: Kobe Nice Basong <kobenmbasong@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 21:53:32 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Add Supabase Auth with email and GitHub sign-in

- AuthController listens to onAuthStateChange
- Login screen with email/password sign in and sign up
- GitHub OAuth as the additional third-party provider
- Router redirects signed-out users to /login
- Account menu with sign out on the home screen
- Register io.supabase.gamecreditsshop redirect scheme on macOS, iOS, Android
- Optional SQL to restrict product reads to signed-in users

